title Manaweave Robe
category Class
class Mage
folder Mage
faction Alliance
levels 15-17
zone Stormwind City
keywords Jennea Cannon, Investigate the Blue Recluse, Gathering Materials, Wynne Larson, Rift Spawn, Charged Rift Gem, Silver Stream Mine, Loch Modan, Manaweave Robe, Mage, class robe
