why A robe at 15 for Alliance mages, from Stormwind and Loch Modan.

# The Alliance mage robe at 15: Report to Jennea (1919), Investigate the Blue
# Recluse (1920), Gathering Materials (1921) and Manaweave Robe (1941).
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json for the chain,
# the coffers and the Rift Spawn in the Blue Recluse, and the Miners' League
# Crates in Loch Modan; Wowhead Forever's Mage class page
# (data/local/quest-audit/wowhead-class-quests.json) and quest pages
# (https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=1920 and 1941, checked 2026-10-14) for
# the races and the reward (Manaweave Robe); the quest texts for the Blue
# Recluse and the Silver Stream Mine.
# Wowhead Forever lists Human, Gnome and Skyborne mages for 1919-1921;
# corrections.json adds Skyborne to 1919 and 1921, which the merged data
# gave to Humans and Gnomes only.
# Investigate the Blue Recluse needs Report to Jennea first (quests.json):
# Zaldimar Wefhellt in Goldshire, Magis Sparkmantle in Kharanos and Dink in
# Ironforge give it.
# Not in a leveling guide: the Charged Rift Gems are only in Loch Modan, which
# no Alliance route visits at this level.

step Zaldimar Wefhellt (Goldshire)
  only Human,Skyborne
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Zaldimar Wefhellt is the Goldshire mage trainer.
  level 15
  accept 1919 npc 328                         -- Zaldimar Wefhellt

step Dink (Ironforge)
  only Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  tip Dink teaches mages in Ironforge's Mystic Ward. Take the Deeprun Tram from Tinker Town to Stormwind afterwards.
  level 15
  accept 1919 npc 7312                        -- Dink

step Jennea Cannon
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Jennea Cannon stands in the Wizard's Sanctum, the tower of the Mage Quarter. The Chest of Containment Coffers and the Cantation of Manifestation lie behind her.
  turnin 1919                                 -- Jennea Cannon
  accept 1920
  collect 7247 quest 1920.2                   -- Chest of Containment Coffers
  collect 7308 quest 1920.3                   -- Cantation of Manifestation

step The Blue Recluse
  tip The Blue Recluse is the tavern in the Mage Quarter. Use the Cantation of Manifestation inside to make the Rift Spawn visible, subdue one with your spells, then use the Chest of Containment Coffers to throw down a coffer and capture it.
  use 7308 optional @51.3,93.3 live           -- Cantation of Manifestation
  kill 6492 optional                          -- Rift Spawn
  collect 7292 quest 1920.1 @51.3,93.3 live   -- Filled Containment Coffer

step Back to Jennea Cannon
  turnin 1920                                 -- Jennea Cannon
  accept 1921

step Linen Cloth
  tip Humanoids drop Linen Cloth; the Auction House in the Trade District sells it.
  collect 2589 quest 1921.1                   -- Linen Cloth

step The Silver Stream Mine
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Take the Deeprun Tram to Ironforge, then the road east through the South Gate tunnel into Loch Modan. The dwarven miners' league left the crates in the Silver Stream Mine at the north end of the loch; Tunnel Rat troggs hold the mine.
  collect 7249 quest 1921.2                   -- Charged Rift Gem: Miners' League Crates

step Wynne Larson
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Back to Stormwind by the tram. Wynne Larson works at Larson Clothiers in the Mage Quarter.
  turnin 1921                                 -- Wynne Larson
  accept 1941
  turnin 1941                                 -- Wynne Larson: Manaweave Robe
